# Intentionally empty.
#
# Stock OppoCamera is a product priv-app (priv_app domain), not platform_app.
# Cross-domain allows (binder_call to HAL, vendor_configs_file read) often hit
# neverallow on AOSP 14–16 and break `sepolicy` compile. Add rules only after
# collecting real `avc: denied` lines on a booted build.
